  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siem miyudo kuom sigand Israel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jowetena, ok adwar ni mondo ukia kaka kwerewa nowuotho e bwo bor polo, to kendo giduto negingʼado Nam Makwar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bedo e bwo bor polono kendo ngʼado nam makwarno ema nokwan ka batiso mane omiyo gibetie achiel gi Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giduto negichamo chiemb chuny machalre",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kendo giduto ne gimodho pi achiel mar chuny, nikech ne gimodho e lwanda mar chuny mane wuotho kodgi; to lwandano ne en Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kata kamano, Nyasaye ne ok omor gi ji mangʼeny kuomgi, kendo ringregi nodongʼ e thim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gigi duto notimore mondo obednwa ranyisi masiemowa mondo kik wagomb gik maricho kaka ne gigombo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kik ulam nyiseche manono kaka moko kuomgi nolamo, mana kaka ondiki niya, \"Ji nobet piny mondo gichiem kendo gimethi, kendo negia malo mondo gimiel miende dwanyruok mag oganda.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kik waterre kaka moko kuomgi notimo, mi ji alufu piero ariyo gadek kuomgi notho odiechiengʼ achiel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kik watem Ruoth, kaka moko kuomgi notimo, mi thuonde nonegogi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bende kik wangʼur, kaka moko kuomgi notimo, mi malaika mar tho nonegogi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gigi duto notimorenigi kaka ranyisi, kendo nondiknwagi mondo gibednwa siem, wan ma wadak e ndalo ma giko piny chiegnini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omiyo, ka iparo ni ichungʼ motegno bed motangʼ, nono to ipodho!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onge tem museneno mopogore gi ma ji duto neno. Nyasaye rito singruokne, ok obi yie mondo otemu mohingo tekreu. To e sa ma itemoueno, obiro miyou yo munyalo tonygo mondo ubed gi teko mar timo sinani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasi mag nyiseche manono kod Sawo mar Ruoth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuom mano, osiepena mageno, ringuru ua kuom nyiseche manono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awuoyo kodu kaka joma parogi nikare, omiyo paruru matut tiend wach ma awachonuno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Donge kikombe mar gweth ma wagoyene Nyasaye erokamano ketowa e lalruok achiel e remb Kristo? Koso makati mwangʼingo donge ketowa e lalruok achiel, e ringre Kristo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikech nitie makati achiel, koro wan ringruok achiel, kata obedo ni wangʼeny, nikech wan duto wachamo makati achielno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka wakawo jo-Israel kaka ranyisi: Donge joma chamo gik mokete kendo mar misango bet e lalruok achiel gi kendo mar misangono?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diponi awacho ni misango mochiwne nyiseche manono en gimoro kata ni nyasaye manono nigi tiende?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ooyo! Awacho ni misango ma jopiny makia Nyasaye timo, gitimo ni jochiende, to ok ni Nyasaye. To ok adwar mondo ubedi e lalruok achiel gi jochiende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ok unyal madho kikombe Ruoth kaachiel gi kikombe jochiende bende; kendo ok unyal chiemo e mesa Ruoth, ka uchiemo e mesa jochiende bende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koso wadwaro miyo Ruoth mirima? Waparo ni watek moloye?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thuolo mar joma oyie kuom Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngʼato nyalo wacho niya, \"Oyiena timo gimoro amora mwadwaro,\" to gik moko duto ma watimo ok kelnwa konyruok. Ngʼat machielo to wacho niya, \"Oyiena timo gimoro amora madwaro,\" to gik moko duto ma watimo ok kelnwa dongruok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kik ngʼato dwar mana gik makonye en owuon, to ngʼato mondo odwar gima konyo jowadgi bende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Un thuolo mar chamo ringʼo mongʼiew e chiro ma ok ubedo gi penjo mathoth e chunyu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nikech Muma wacho niya, \"Piny kaachiel gi gik moko duto manie iye, gin mag Jehova Nyasaye.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ngʼat ma ok oyie kuom Kristo ogweli e chiemo, kendo ihero dhi, to cham gimoro amora moketi e nyimi ma ok ichich gi penjo mathoth e chunyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka ngʼato onyisi niya, \"Chiemoni ne olosi mondo otimgo misango ne nyiseche manono,\" to kik icham chiemono, nikech wach ma ngʼatno onyisino, kendo nikech wach mar chich ma in-go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tim kamano mar konyo chuny ngʼatno, to ok nikech konyruokni. Ere gima omiyo paro manie chuny ngʼat machielo ema mona timo gima aneno ni an gi thuolo mar timo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka agoyo erokamano ni chiemo ma achamo, to angʼo momiyo ikwana ka jaketho ne gima agoyonee Nyasaye erokamano?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omiyo gimoro amora mutimo, bed ni uchiemo kata umetho, to timgiuru duto mondo Nyasaye oyud duongʼ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
